<title>CANADA: Gold Canyon gets other half of Springpole.</title>
<headline>Gold Canyon gets other half of Springpole.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, B.C. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Canyon Resources Inc said Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp has assigned its 50 percent interest in the Springpole Project to Gold Canyon, giving the company a 100 percent interest in the project located in northwestern Ontario.</p>
<p>Gold Canyon said it is examining a variety of options with a view to carrying out a winter drilling program there which is expected to start early next year.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
